        <div id="sectionGuide" class="space-y-6 hidden">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-6">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Panduan Lengkap & Rumus Perhitungan HPP</h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Pedoman praktis dan rumus standar bagi pelaku UMKM, Manufaktur, Kuliner, dan Toko Retail di Indonesia.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                    <!-- Guide 1: Manufaktur & Kuliner -->
                    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50/50 border border-emerald-200/80 space-y-3">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">1</div>
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-900 text-base">HPP Manufaktur & Kuliner (F&B)</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-emerald-950/80 leading-relaxed">
                            Bagi usaha yang memproduksi sendiri barang (membuat makanan, kopi, kue, pakaian, kerajinan, dsb.), biaya produksi terdiri dari 3 elemen utama:
                        </p>
                        <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 font-mono text-xs text-emerald-800 space-y-1">
                            <div><strong>Total Biaya Produksi</strong> = Bahan Baku + Tenaga Kerja + Overhead (BOP)</div>
                            <div><strong>HPP per Unit</strong> = Total Biaya Produksi &divide; Jumlah Unit Dihasilkan</div>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
                            <li><strong>Bahan Baku:</strong> bahan habis pakai untuk produk (misal: kopi, susu, cup, sedotan, kain, benang).</li>
                            <li><strong>Tenaga Kerja:</strong> upah barista, koki, penjahit, operator produksi per batch.</li>
                            <li><strong>Overhead (BOP):</strong> listrik mesin, gas LPG, sewa proporsional, penyusutan alat, plastik kresek.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Guide 2: Perusahaan Dagang -->
                    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50/50 border border-indigo-200/80 space-y-3">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">2</div>
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-indigo-900 text-base">HPP Perusahaan Dagang / Retail</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-indigo-950/80 leading-relaxed">
                            Bagi toko kelontong, supermarket, distributor, atau reseller yang membeli barang jadi untuk dijual kembali tanpa proses produksi:
                        </p>
                        <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 font-mono text-xs text-indigo-800 space-y-1">
                            <div><strong>Pembelian Bersih</strong> = Pembelian + Ongkos Angkut - (Retur + Potongan)</div>
                            <div><strong>Barang Tersedia Dijual</strong> = Persediaan Awal + Pembelian Bersih</div>
                            <div><strong>HPP</strong> = Barang Tersedia Dijual - Persediaan Akhir</div>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
                            <li><strong>Persediaan Awal:</strong> nilai rupiah stok barang di awal bulan.</li>
                            <li><strong>Persediaan Akhir:</strong> nilai rupiah stok barang di akhir bulan (setelah stock opname).</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Guide 3: Markup vs Margin -->
                <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-amber-50/60 border border-amber-200/80 space-y-3">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-950 text-base flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-amber-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">!</span>
                        Penting: Perbedaan Markup on Cost vs Margin on Sales
                    </h3>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs text-amber-950/90 leading-relaxed">
                        <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-amber-200">
                            <strong class="text-slate-900 block mb-1">1. Markup on Cost (Persentase dari Modal HPP)</strong>
                            <p class="mb-2">Menambahkan persentase keuntungan di atas harga modal.</p>
                            <code class="text-emerald-700 font-bold block bg-slate-50 p-1.5 rounded">Harga Jual = HPP &times; (1 + % Markup)</code>
                            <p class="mt-2 text-slate-500">Contoh: HPP Rp 10.000 dengan markup 50% = Harga Jual <strong>Rp 15.000</strong> (Laba Rp 5.000).</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-amber-200">
                            <strong class="text-slate-900 block mb-1">2. Margin on Sales (Persentase dari Harga Jual)</strong>
                            <p class="mb-2">Menentukan bahwa sekian persen dari uang penjualan adalah laba bersih.</p>
                            <code class="text-indigo-700 font-bold block bg-slate-50 p-1.5 rounded">Harga Jual = HPP &divide; (1 - % Margin)</code>
